{{Is-Numeral(fjórir)|}}

===Etymology===
Old Norse

===Numeral===
'''fjórir''' {{m|p}}, '''[[fjórar]]''' {{f|p}}, '''[[fjögur]]''' {{n|p}}

# '''[[four]]'''; the cardinal number after [[þrír#Icelandic|þrír]] and before [[fimm#Icelandic|fimm]].
#: ''[[sjá|Sjáðu]]''! '''Fjórir''' [[maður#Icelandic|menn]].''
#:: [[look|Look]]! '''Four''' [[man|men]].

